id: 29
hanzi: 因而
pinyin: yīn ér
level: HSK 5
part_of_speech: Conjunction

meanings_summary:
  en: therefore; as a result; thus; consequently
  es: por lo tanto; en consecuencia; por ende; de ahí que

senses[1]{sense_number,part_of_speech,register,definition_en,definition_es,example_phrase}:
  1 | Conjunction | Standard | connects two clauses to indicate that the latter is the natural consequence, result, or deduction from the former | conector lógico que enlaza dos proposiciones indicando que la segunda es consecuencia directa de la primera | 因而不受干扰 (consequently free from disturbance)

example_sentences[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 四合院的四面建筑紧密围合，隔绝了外界街巷的喧嚣，因而能够为院内居民营造出安宁静谧的生活氛围。 | Sìhéyuàn de sìmiàn jiànzhù jǐnmì wéihé, géjué le wàijiè jiēxiàng de xuānxīao, yīn'ér nénggòu wèi yuànnèi jūmín yíngzào chū ānníng jìngmì de shēnghuó fēnwéi. | The quadrangle's four-sided structures tightly enclose the space, sealing off exterior alley clamor; as a result, it fosters an ambiance of serene quiet. | Los edificios del siheyuan cierran el recinto aislando el estruendo de los callejones, por lo que brindan a los vecinos un sosiego reconfortante.
  #2 | 实验室采用了最先进的高精度自动化仪器，因而大幅度提升了日常科研数据的采集效率与准确度。 | Shíyànshì cǎiyòng le zuì xiānjìn de gāojīngdù zìdònghuà yíqì, yīn'ér dàfúdù tíshēng le rìcháng kēyán shùjù de cǎijí xiàolǜ yǔ zhǔnquèdù. | The laboratory adopted state-of-the-art high-precision automated instruments; consequently, data acquisition efficiency and precision soared. | El laboratorio incorporó instrumentación automatizada de alta precisión, mejorando sustancialmente la rapidez y exactitud en la recolección de datos.

collocations[6]{hanzi,en}:
  因而产生 | consequently produce / arise
  因而获益 | benefit as a result
  因而受到好评 | consequently earn high praise
  因而发生变化 | consequently undergo change
  因而推断 | deduce as a result
  因而得名 | derive its name as a result

idioms[4]{hanzi,pinyin,meaning_en}:
  水到渠成 | shuǐ dào qú chéng | when water flows, a canal is formed; matters succeed naturally
  顺理成章 | shùn lǐ chéng zhāng | follow logically and smoothly; natural course of events
  因势利导 | yīn shì lì dǎo | guide action along existing momentum
  防患未然 | fáng huàn wèi rán | prevent troubles before they happen

character_decomposition[2]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,meaning_es,radical,radical_meaning_en,meaning_component,sound_component,stroke_count,composition_type,etymology_and_mnemonic,visual_mnemonic_story_en,visual_mnemonic_story_es,tone_mnemonic_anchor,cangjie,traditional}:
  因 | yīn | cause; reason; because; rely on | causa; motivo; por; apoyarse en | 囗 | enclosure | 囗 (enclosure) + 大 (person resting on mat) | 因 (yīn) | 6 | 全包围结构 | A person 大 resting securely upon an enclosed sleeping mat 囗; represents the ground, basis, or cause. | A person (大) reclining on a woven resting mat (囗) as the basis and reason for rest (因). | Una persona (大) descansando sobre una estera (囗), fundamento y causa de su reposo (因). | 55 | WK | 因
  而 | ér | and; yet; but; and then | y; además; pero; por ende | 而 | beard / whiskers | pictograph of flowing facial whiskers or chin beard | 而 (ér) | 6 | 单一结构 | Flowing facial whiskers hanging downward; serves as a universal connective marker in speech. | Flowing wisps of a sage's beard (而) smoothly connecting thoughts together. | Los mechones de la barba de un sabio (而) que enlazan con fluidez ideas sucesivas. | 35 | MBLL | 而

mnemonics_and_roots:
  composite_memory_hook_en: Taking a cause (因) and carrying it forward (而) yields the conclusive result (因而).
  composite_memory_hook_es: Tomar la causa originaria (因) y proseguir el curso lógico (而) arroja el desenlace natural (因而).
  cultural_and_cognitive_roots: A formal coordinating consecutive conjunction in written Chinese that seamlessly ties prerequisite conditions to inevitable outcomes.
  tone_sandhi_and_pitch_modulation: First tone to second tone: 'yīn ér' (55-35). Start with a level high pitch on 'yīn', then rise smoothly on 'ér'.

traps_and_cognates:
  look_alikes[4]{character,pinyin,meaning_en,distinction_note}:
    田 | tián | field; farmland | Cross inside 囗 instead of 大
    四 | sì | four | Eight 八 inside 囗 instead of 大
    面 | miàn | face; surface | Contains 自/目 frame at the top
    耍 | shuǎ | play; fool with | Woman radical 女 under 而
  etymological_cognates[4]{character,pinyin,gloss_en}:
    因为 | yīnwèi | because; owing to
    原因 | yuányīn | cause; origin
    因此 | yīncǐ | therefore; consequently
    而且 | érqiě | moreover; furthermore

semantic_boundary_contrasts:
  core_nuance: 因而 explicitly marks an inevitable outcome or natural consequence resulting from the preceding premise.
  contrasts[3]{id,compared_word,pinyin,analysis}:
    1 | 因而 vs. 因为 | yīnwèi | 因为 introduces the causal antecedent ('because'), whereas 因而 introduces the resulting consequence ('consequently').
    2 | 因而 vs. 因此 | yīncǐ | 因此 is broader and common in spoken register, while 因而 highlights the causal chain's natural progression.
    3 | 因而 vs. 反而 | fǎn'ér | 反而 indicates an outcome contrary to expectations, whereas 因而 confirms expected logical consequences.

extended_reading_passages[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 老北京四合院的建筑格局严格遵照坐北朝南的朝向，正房因而能够在一整年里获取最充沛的日照与良好的自然通风。夏季南风徐来，冬季北风受阻，因而形成了一个极为适宜日常安居的健康微气候。 | Lǎo Běijīng sìhéyuàn de jiànzhù guīzhì yángé zūnzhào zuòběi-cháonán de cháoxiàng, zhèngfáng yīn'ér nénggòu zài yī zhěng nián lǐ huòqǔ zuì chōngpèi de rìzhào yǔ liánghǎo de zìrán tōngfēng. Xiàjì nánfēng xú lái, dōngjì běifēng shòuzǔ, yīn'ér xíngchéng le yī gè jíwéi shìyí rìcháng ānjū de jiànkāng wēiqìhòu. | Beijing quadrangles strictly face south; as a result, the main room obtains optimal daylight and natural ventilation year-round. Summer breezes enter while winter gales are blocked; consequently, a healthy microclimate is forged. | El siheyuan pekinés se orienta estrictamente al sur; de ahí que su sala principal disfrute de luz y ventilación óptimas todo el año. En verano entran brisas y en invierno se frena el cierzo, forjando un microclima ideal.
  #2 | 科研团队在关键算法的设计中始终贯彻轻量化理念，代码执行效率因而提升了数倍，能源消耗因而显著降低。这项突破不仅赢得了国际同行的广泛赞誉，更因而为公司在激烈的海外市场竞争中赢得了宝贵的先机。 | Kēyán tuánduì zài guānjiàn suànfǎ de shèjì zhōng shǐzhōng guàngchè qīngliànghuà lǐniàn, dàimǎ zhíxíng xiàolǜ yīn'ér tíshēng le shù bèi, néngyuán xiāohào yīn'ér xiǎnzhù jiàngdī. Zhè xiàng tūpò bùjǐn yíngdé le guójì tóngháng de guǎngfàn zànyù, gèng yīn'ér wèi gōngsī zài jīliè de hǎiwài shìchǎng jìngzhēng zhōng yíngdé le bǎoguì de xiānjī. | The research team pursued lightweight design in its algorithms; consequently, execution efficiency surged and power consumption dropped. This breakthrough not only won international praise, but thus secured an advantage in markets. | El equipo aplicó criterios de aligeramiento en sus algoritmos, multiplicando la velocidad y reduciendo el consumo; este logro cosechó elogios internacionales y por ende aseguró una valiosa ventaja comercial.
